## Why This Is Asked
Tests understanding of low‑level memory management, freelists, and fixed-size allocators.

## Key Concepts
- Fixed-size blocks and simple freelist
- In-block metadata for next pointer
- Alignment guarantees and fragmentation considerations

## Code Example
